{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415760","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415760","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1041576001:1":{"text":"赫托啊！我没看错，真的是冬喉女士！","source_cn":"赫托啊！我没看错，真的是冬喉女士！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1149BFFC2A396885","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041576002:1":{"text":"叫我阿尔娜就好。","source_cn":"叫我阿尔娜就好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8057B3B962F34BD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041576003:0":{"text":"不不不，这样显得太不尊重您了！我们矮人都听过您的传说！","source_cn":"不不不，这样显得太不尊重您了！我们矮人都听过您的传说！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DC7DDBD45D1F8FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041576004:0":{"text":"一位伟大的半神战士，孤身一人突破了魔物的封锁，拯救了炉卫城……","source_cn":"一位伟大的半神战士，孤身一人突破了魔物的封锁，拯救了炉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x423BD36611C7AB43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041576005:0":{"text":"我并不是一个人，还有位勇敢的矮人朋友，他叫格尼兹。","source_cn":"我并不是一个人，还有位勇敢的矮人朋友，他叫格尼兹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74B162967E7245D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041576006:0":{"text":"对！格尼兹大师！就是他制定了现在通用的武器锻造工艺规范！","source_cn":"对！格尼兹大师！就是他制定了现在通用的武器锻造工艺规范！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19CC8499A1F74D87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041576007:0":{"text":"他说过，正因曾经有幸与您并肩作战，他才会明白一把合格武器必备的要素都是什么。","source_cn":"他说过，正因曾经有幸与您并肩作战，他才会明白一把合格武...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09F6AC0305F5CD17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041576008:0":{"text":"他不屈的精神才是致胜的关键。","source_cn":"他不屈的精神才是致胜的关键。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA544F8049353F0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041576009:0":{"text":"他也说过！这正是从您身上学到的！","source_cn":"他也说过！这正是从您身上学到的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD82B8D99FD8A5F54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041576010:1":{"text":"谬赞了，孩子。是我们相互支撑，才打赢了那场战役。","source_cn":"谬赞了，孩子。是我们相互支撑，才打赢了那场战役。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44016C63D8EB9CA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041576011:1":{"text":"说到格尼兹，他的孙子还好吗？我很久没有回炉卫城了。","source_cn":"说到格尼兹，他的孙子还好吗？我很久没有回炉卫城了。","status":"matched",